## RISK MITIGATION

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|-----------|
| Semantic drift | Snapshot testing + manual verification |
| Missing mutations | Mutation spy + pre/post profiling |
| Auth duplicated | Code review + trace inspection |
| Handler reachability | Execution trace assertions |
| Response format change | JSON schema comparison |
| Telemetry divergence | Telemetry event class assertions |

